Even with Group 3 (`T-a`–`T-j`) and early Gate `N2` (mechanized vacuity) added to the PR tier, the entire PR gate suite finishes in **~115–125 seconds (~2 minutes) after `lake build`**, leaving an 8-minute margin inside the 10-minute PR cap:

1. **Fast shell, ledger, hygiene, and lexical checks (`< 3s` total):**
   `check_issues.sh` (including **T-j** bug-to-fixture check), `check_roadmap.sh`, `check_Toolchain.sh`, `check_workflows.sh`, `check_gate_hygiene.sh`, `trust_ban.sh`, and **X1** (`imports.sh`).
