## 5. PR-Tier Cost & Integration with `scripts/proofs/axioms.sh` and `ConcreteSpec`

### PR-Tier Cost
- **Wall-clock time: `~2–3 seconds` on PR** (once `ConcreteSpec` oleans are built by `lake build ConcreteSpec`).
- Why it is so fast: `theorems.lean` already imports `ConcreteSpec` and iterates over `env.constants` in `~2.5s`. Running `PROOF_MODE=vacuity` inside the **same** `scripts/proofs/theorems.lean` binary (or `scripts/proofs/vacuity.lean`) inspects ~70 theorem `ConstantInfo` entries in memory without spawning extra Lean processes or re-elaborating files.

### Integration with `scripts/proofs/axioms.sh`'s Population
- Currently, [scripts/proofs/axioms.sh](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/prop-agy/scripts/proofs/axioms.sh#L45-L60) runs `theorems.lean` in two passes (`PROOF_MODE=axioms` comparing against `scripts/proofs/axioms.golden`, and `PROOF_MODE=heads` checking universe-monomorphic inductive heads on `Concrete.slice0_soundness`).
- Integrate Gate `N2` and `T-g` directly into `scripts/proofs/` so the population is unified:
  1. `PROOF_MODE=axioms` checks the axiom footprint of every theorem in `ConcreteSpec` and `Concrete` against `axioms.golden`. (Update `axioms.sh` so `@[witness ...]` and `@[refutes ...]` theorems are verified for zero `sorryAx`/non-standard axioms automatically without requiring manual edits to `axioms.golden` for every helper/witness if desired, OR keep `@[law]` + headline theorems in `axioms.golden` and check all constants in `ConcreteSpec` and `Concrete` for `sorryAx` / non-standard axioms).
  2. `PROOF_MODE=statements` (**T-g**) prints `<law-or-headline-theorem>\t<sha256-of-canonical-dag>` and diffs against `scripts/proofs/statements.golden`.
  3. `PROOF_MODE=vacuity` (**Gate N2**) verifies completeness (every theorem in `ConcreteSpec` has `@[law]`, `@[witness]`, `@[refutes]`, `@[helper]`, or `@[law_exempt]`), runs `(v1)`, `(v2)`, and `(v3)` on every `@[law]`, verifies the 4 planted controls in `ConcreteSpec.VacuityControls`, and diffs any `@[law_exempt]` against `scripts/proofs/vacuity_exemptions.golden`.
- Add `bash scripts/proofs/vacuity.sh` (or call it from `scripts/proofs/axioms.sh`) in [scripts/checks/run.sh](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/prop-agy/scripts/checks/run.sh#L17) right after `axioms.sh`, so it runs on **every PR and spec branch push**.

